The '''Trite''' is a spider variant of the {{e|Hopper}}s. Leaps with less frequency, but at greater distances. This can make them extremely dangerous, as they could potentially leap from one side of the room to the other, catching the player off guard.
{{clear}}

== Variants ==
=== Ragling ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Ragling
 | id          = 246
 | base hp     = 13
 | environment = {{floor|Cellar}}<br>{{floor|Caves}}{{floor|Catacombs}}{{floor|Flooded Caves}}<br>{{floor|Depths}}{{floor|Necropolis}}{{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{floor|Mausoleum}}<br>{{floor|Cathedral}}
