=== Rag Man's Ragling ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a
 | name        = {{dlcalt|Rag man's Rag Ling|r=Rag Man's Ragling}}
 | variant     = 1
 | base hp     = 30
 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}{{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Mausoleum}}<br>{{floor|Chest}}<br>{{room|boss}}
