== Notes ==
* If Blisters aren't unlocked yet, they are replaced by Trites in Normal mode, or {{e|Ticking Spider}}s in [[Hard mode]].

== Trivia ==
* A trite is the name of a genus of the jumping spider family.
* Trites share the same name with an [http://doomwiki.org/wiki/Trite enemy in Doom 3], an enemy that leaps towards the player and has an upside-down human-like face.
* {{dlc|a+}} Blisters were given a shooting animation in [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #5|Booster Pack #5]], based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=918695562 this Steam Workshop mod] by TheShadyOne.
* {{dlc|a+}} Blisters originally had 54 base hp and 0 stage hp; however, this was changed in Booster Pack #5.
** Blisters had the fifth-highest base health of all the non-boss enemies, after {{e|Dinga}}s, {{e|Mama Guts}}, {{e|MemBrain}}s, and {{e|Oob}}s.

